\pard\sa140\sl276\slmult1\qc\f1\fs26 A small, quiet window for talking to any model.\
\pard\sa120\sl264\slmult1\ql\f0\fs22 \
Cove is a native macOS chat client for AI models. One 540\'a0\'d7\'a0640 window you can pin above your work \'97 no sidebar, no account, no backend.\
\
Connect a local server (Ollama or LM Studio, on this Mac or another computer on your network) or an API key from a provider you already pay for, and switch models from the composer.\
\
Conversations are stored on this Mac with SwiftData and keys live in the Keychain. Nothing leaves your machine until you approve each external endpoint. No telemetry, no Electron, no service of our own.\
\
Swift 6 and SwiftUI. Open source.\
